; ＠ト書き▼議論シーン1-5 シェリーのボウガン

# Judge1-5-1

; BGM変更：rAwTell Owk...
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_7_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我是<link=\"Objection_01_01_05_01\">前天晚上</link><br>把弩枪借走的。<br>那时弩枪上面<br>已经没有箭了。|#0101Trial05_Sherry001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因为我没办法<br>用拆散的零件复原，<br>于是我就把零件保存到<br>房间前面的桶了！|#0101Trial05_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:过道角落的桶<br>不是垃圾桶吗……？|#0101Trial05_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,60 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……不过，<br>我也确认了前天<br>只有箭不见了。<br>我想她说的<br>应该是实话……|#0101Trial05_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:但也有可能，<br>橘把箭也偷走了，不是吗。<br>偷完箭后，<br>又想着把本体也偷走……<br>我猜是这样。|#0101Trial05_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:39,45 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"啊～，蛮有可能的～<br>拿到箭之后就想射射看，<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_05_02\">就把她给杀了</link>，<br>难道不是吗？|#0101Trial05_Coco001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Angry1,ArmR3,ArmL4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我才不会做<br>这么漏洞百出的事！<br>气鼓鼓！|#0101Trial05_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,55 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:呃，气鼓鼓是什么意思啊。<br>怎么会有人用嘴说<br>漫画效果音的？<br>真恶心……|#0101Trial05_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

